  "id": "clementine-and-poppy-seed-stollen",
  "name": "Clementine and Poppy Seed Stollen",
  "subtitle": "A fragrant fruit-and-marzipan loaf with citrus and warm spice",
  "description": "A tender stollen-style bake combining clementine zest, poppy seeds, dried fruit, cherries, and marzipan, finished with butter and icing sugar.",
